WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.720
Ryu falls from the prerequisite normal forward throw.

2
00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:01.150
Raw Drive Rush closes the distance during wake-up.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.510
Rush crouching medium punch hits Ryu on wake-up.

4
00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:02.300
Standing medium punch follows the Rush starter.

5
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.000
Light Dégagé ends the confirm.

6
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Ryu recovers after the low ender.
